# Basilica Stalker has flying (CR 702.9b): Bot2's Memnite cannot block it (refused), but its Ornithopter, which has flying, can. Damage dealt to a blocking creature is not damage
# to a player, so there is no life gain and no surveil (CR 510.2): Bot1 stays at 20 and the top of its library is untouched. The Stalker takes no damage from the 0/2 Ornithopter
# and deals its 3 to it, killing it; the unblocked attack in basilica-stalker-flies-and-combat-damage-to-a-player-gains-1-life-and-surveils-1 is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Basilica Stalker
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island x21

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Basilica Stalker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Basilica Stalker > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Memnite > Basilica Stalker)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Basilica Stalker)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
